# Vitest browser-mode screenshot attachments (transient)
.vitest-attachments/
# Vitest browser-mode FAILURE screenshots, written next to the failing spec
# (`test/__screenshots__/<spec>/<test-name>.png`). Transient debug output — the
# sibling of the attachments dir above, which was ignored while this one was not.
**/test/__screenshots__/
